flowchart TB
 subgraph frontend[客户端]
   web[Web 应用]
   app[移动 App]
 end
 subgraph platform[平台]
   subgraph access[接入]
     gateway[API 网关]
     auth{已授权?}
   end
   subgraph services[服务]
     content[内容服务]
     search[搜索服务]
   end
 end
 db[(数据库)]
 web --> gateway
 app --> gateway
 gateway --> auth
 auth -->|通过| content
 auth -.->|拒绝| web
 content <--> search
 content --> db
 gateway -->|审计| db
 db -->|重试| db
